  "analysis_md": "设 $F(x,y,z)=e^{yz}+x\\sin(x+y)-z$，则\n\n$$F_x(\\frac{\\pi}{2},0,1+\\frac{\\pi}{2})=\\sin(x+y)=1,$$\n\n$$F_y(\\frac{\\pi}{2},0,1+\\frac{\\pi}{2})=ze^{yz}+x\\cos(x+y)=1+\\frac{\\pi}{2},$$\n\n$$F_z(\\frac{\\pi}{2},0,1+\\frac{\\pi}{2})=ye^{yz}-1=-1,$$\n\n法线方程为：$\\frac{x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}{1}=\\frac{y}{1+\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\frac{z-1-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}{-1}$。",
